			<div class="content" id="post-content-2782929">
									

<p>Funny thing, when I first started working on the original concept for this (three or four overhauls ago), the similarity to the Adipose was the first thing people brought up. I hadn't heard of them before that day, and I've tried my darndest to differentiate from that concept, but when the goal is 'happy fat', there's only so much you can do.</p>
<p>The original seed of this idea came from my little brother, who hasn't seen any Dr. Who either, for what it's worth, but the end result is a lot different than what he came up with.</p>
<p>Glad you liked it! And I might write more about these things when I have both motivation, and an idea at the same time.</p>

